  ($qb$HEAIL-COM-MCQ-032$qb$, $qb$A3-02$qb$, $qb$MCQ$qb$, $qb$Your message to a colleague went unanswered for three days. What is the best next step?$qb$, $qb$Send a short message asking whether they received it$qb$, $qb$Speak to them directly, since email is clearly not reaching them$qb$, $qb$Resend the original message with a note asking for a reply$qb$, $qb$Copy their manager in when you send it again$qb$, $qb$Assume they are busy and wait a few more days$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
