  ($qb$HEAIL-CRD-FIB-012$qb$, $qb$A3-03$qb$, $qb$FIB$qb$, $qb$A conflict left unspoken between two people tends to reach the rest of the ______.$qb$, $qb$team$qb$, $qb$meeting$qb$, $qb$argument$qb$, $qb$city$qb$, $qb$day$qb$, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, true),
  ($qb$HEAIL-CRD-FIB-013$qb$, $qb$A3-03$qb$, $qb$FIB$qb$, $qb$Setting a time to come back to a stalled argument stops it being settled by ______.$qb$, $qb$exhaustion$qb$, $qb$email$qb$, $qb$printing$qb$, $qb$filing$qb$, $qb$scheduling$qb$, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, true),
