  ($qb$HEAIL-CRD-FIB-017$qb$, $qb$A3-03$qb$, $qb$FIB$qb$, $qb$An argument settled by whoever is more senior is settled but not ______.$qb$, $qb$resolved$qb$, $qb$recorded$qb$, $qb$scheduled$qb$, $qb$summarised$qb$, $qb$reported$qb$, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, true),
  ($qb$HEAIL-CRD-MCQ-018$qb$, $qb$A3-03$qb$, $qb$MCQ$qb$, $qb$Two of your team have stopped speaking to each other after falling out. Both are upset. The work is being affected. What is the best first step?$qb$, $qb$Speak to each of them separately to hear what happened$qb$, $qb$Bring them together and ask them to work it out$qb$, $qb$Tell them the work matters more than the disagreement$qb$, $qb$Ask other team members what the disagreement was about$qb$, $qb$Wait a few days, since these things usually settle themselves$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
