  ($qb$HEAIL-PIC-FIB-003$qb$, $qb$A3-06$qb$, $qb$FIB$qb$, $qb$Showing one clear example convinces more people than listing ten ______.$qb$, $qb$reasons$qb$, $qb$sources$qb$, $qb$figures$qb$, $qb$options$qb$, $qb$warnings$qb$, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, true),
