  ($qb$HEAIL-LCS-FIB-009$qb$, $qb$A3-04$qb$, $qb$FIB$qb$, $qb$A joke that depends on local knowledge leaves everyone else working out whether to ______.$qb$, $qb$laugh$qb$, $qb$answer$qb$, $qb$explain$qb$, $qb$object$qb$, $qb$repeat$qb$, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, true),
  ($qb$HEAIL-LCS-FIB-010$qb$, $qb$A3-04$qb$, $qb$FIB$qb$, $qb$Asking someone to repeat themselves is more respectful than pretending you ______.$qb$, $qb$understood$qb$, $qb$paid$qb$, $qb$listened$qb$, $qb$noticed$qb$, $qb$replied$qb$, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, true),
  ($qb$HEAIL-LCS-FIB-011$qb$, $qb$A3-04$qb$, $qb$FIB$qb$, $qb$Learning how a name is pronounced signals that the person is worth the ______.$qb$, $qb$effort$qb$, $qb$delay$qb$, $qb$correction$qb$, $qb$introduction$qb$, $qb$meeting$qb$, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, true),
